<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#071B33">
<title>RÉNOVA QUIZ</title>
<style>
:root{
--bg:#071B33;--card:#0D3554;--cyan:#20D6C7;
--green:#10B981;--red:#F04452;--silver:#B9D4E8;
--gold:#FFD166;--white:#fff
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{
margin:0;padding:16px;min-height:100vh;color:var(--white);
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
background:radial-gradient(circle at top right,#124c70,transparent 40%),var(--bg)
}
main{max-width:700px;margin:auto}
header{text-align:center;padding:22px 0}
.logo{
display:inline-grid;place-items:center;width:64px;height:64px;
border-radius:20px;background:var(--cyan);color:var(--bg);
font-size:30px;font-weight:bold
}
h1{font-size:clamp(28px,7vw,42px);letter-spacing:2px;margin:12px 0 5px}
h1 span{color:var(--cyan)}
.muted{color:var(--silver);line-height:1.6}
.panel{
background:#0D3554dd;border:1px solid #ffffff20;
border-radius:20px;padding:20px;margin-bottom:18px
}
.categories{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin:20px 0}
.category{
padding:14px 10px;text-align:left;color:white;
background:var(--bg);border:1px solid #ffffff22;border-radius:14px
}
.category.selected,.category:hover{border-color:var(--cyan);background:#10415c}
.category span{display:block;font-size:25px;margin-bottom:8px}
.category strong{font-size:14px}
.category small{display:block;margin-top:5px;color:var(--silver)}
button{font:inherit;cursor:pointer}
.btn{
width:100%;padding:14px;border:0;border-radius:12px;
font-weight:bold
}
.primary{background:var(--cyan);color:var(--bg)}
.secondary{background:#ffffff12;color:white;border:1px solid #ffffff25}
button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}
.hidden{display:none!important}
.topline{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;font-size:13px;color:var(--silver)}
.timer{color:var(--gold);font-weight:bold;font-size:17px}
.danger{color:var(--red)}
.track{height:8px;background:#ffffff20;border-radius:10px;margin:17px 0;overflow:hidden}
.bar{height:100%;background:var(--cyan);width:0;transition:width .2s}
.question{font-size:22px;line-height:1.45;margin:22px 0}
.answers{display:grid;gap:10px}
.answer{
display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;width:100%;padding:13px;
border-radius:12px;text-align:left;color:white;
background:var(--bg);border:1px solid #ffffff20
}
.answer .letter{
display:grid;place-items:center;flex-shrink:0;width:30px;height:30px;
border-radius:8px;background:#ffffff15;font-weight:bold
}
.answer.correct{background:#0b503f;border-color:var(--green)}
.answer.wrong{background:#55212e;border-color:var(--red)}
.answer:disabled{opacity:1}
.feedback{padding:13px;margin-top:15px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--bg);line-height:1.6}
.good{border-left:4px solid var(--green)}
.bad{border-left:4px solid var(--red)}
.actions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-top:15px}
.actions button{font-size:14px;padding:12px 5px}
.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px;margin:20px 0}
.stat{padding:13px 4px;text-align:center;border-radius:12px;background:var(--bg)}
.stat strong{display:block;color:var(--cyan);font-size:22px}
.stat small{display:block;color:var(--silver);font-size:11px;margin-top:5px}
.center{text-align:center}
.big{font-size:50px}
.best{color:var(--gold);text-align:center;margin:15px 0;font-weight:bold}
.review{padding:13px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:12px;margin:10px 0;line-height:1.6}
footer{text-align:center;color:var(--silver);font-size:12px;padding:20px}
@media(max-width:380px){
body{padding:10px}.panel{padding:14px}.categories{gap:7px}
.category{padding:12px 7px}.topline{font-size:11px}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<header>
<div class="logo">R</div>
<h1>RÉNOVA <span>QUIZ</span></h1>
<div class="muted">Apprends · Réfléchis · Progresse</div>
</header>

<section id="home" class="panel">
<h2>Bienvenue dans ton quiz ! 🌊</h2>
<p class="muted">Choisis une catégorie. Chaque partie comporte 10 questions aléatoires. Tu as 20 secondes par question.</p>
<div id="categories" class="categories"></div>
<div id="bestHome" class="best"></div>
<button id="start" class="btn primary" disabled>COMMENCER →</button>
<p class="muted center">8 catégories · 96 questions</p>
</section>

<section id="game" class="panel hidden">
<div class="topline">
<span id="catLabel"></span>
<span id="count"></span>
<span id="timer" class="timer">20 s</span>
</div>
<div class="track"><div id="bar" class="bar"></div></div>
<div id="question" class="question"></div>
<div id="answers" class="answers"></div>
<div id="feedback" class="feedback hidden"></div>
<div id="hint" class="feedback hidden"></div>
<div class="actions">
<button id="hintBtn" class="btn secondary">💡 Indice</button>
<button id="next" class="btn primary hidden">Suivant →</button>
</div>
</section>

<section id="result" class="panel hidden">
<div id="resultIcon" class="big center">🏆</div>
<h2 id="resultTitle" class="center"></h2>
<p id="message" class="muted center"></p>
<div class="stats">
<div class="stat"><strong id="score"></strong><small>Bonnes réponses</small></div>
<div class="stat"><strong id="percent"></strong><small>Réussite</small></div>
<div class="stat"><strong id="points"></strong><small>Points</small></div>
</div>
<div id="bestResult" class="best"></div>
<h3>📚 Corrections</h3>
<div id="review"></div>
<button id="replay" class="btn primary">🔄 REJOUER</button>
<br><br>
<button id="homeBtn" class="btn secondary">← Accueil</button>
</section>
<footer>RÉNOVA QUIZ · Le savoir est une force.</footer>
</main>

